<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Yamaha Sirius Weekly Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>The Yamaha Sirius rents at a verified 700,000 VND per week in Hanoi, which is 100,000 VND per day when the week is used fully. This guide plans a weekly rental around that number: what the weekly rate buys, how it beats the daily rate, what to check at handover, and when a shorter or longer period is the better structure.</p>
<p>We cover the verified price, the Sirius as a machine, a realistic weekly budget for a seven-day stay, the break-even against the 150,000 VND daily rate and the 900,000 to 1,200,000 VND monthly rate, and the extras, deposit, gear and fuel, that turn the headline rate into a real weekly budget. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">The verified weekly price</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">What the Sirius buys for a week</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">Planning a weekly budget</a></li>
